  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">將可馴服的貓鼬加入遊戲中，在需要時會為你戰鬥並保護你。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們是雜食性動物，所以可以吃任何東西。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以使用任何食物道具來馴服和繁殖牠們。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">若未被馴服，牠們會躲避玩家和怪物，但你可以用食物誘導牠們靠近你。</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以在熱帶草原生物羣系中找到牠們。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（在 Forge 中，你可以透過編輯 data -&gt; 生物羣系標籤與生物羣系修改器資料夾中的 JSON 檔案，或使用資源包來更改此項及其他生成設定；在 Fabric 中則有相關的設定檔）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模組目前支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 |1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 |1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1105/8/ezgif-7c80eb91372f56.gif\" alt=\"animations\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果你需要在 CurseForge 上取得其他版本的模組，請給我發送私人訊息</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模組需要安裝 AQUARIUSLIBS</strong></a></span></p>",
